[en.DECISION_C01_C14_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION]
Secret Investigation In Appleloosa

[en.DECISION_C01_C14_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION_desc]
Although the Appleloosa is a de jure part of the Equestria Empire, Cozy Glow feels that the Empire has no actual control over the Appleloosa. She decides to send a secret investigation team to the Appleloosa to find out what is going on there.

[zh.DECISION_C01_C14_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION]
秘密调查苹果鲁萨

[zh.DECISION_C01_C14_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION_desc]
即使苹果鲁萨是小马利亚帝国的正式一部分，和煦光流觉得帝国对苹果鲁萨没有实际控制。她决定派遣一支秘密调查队伍前往苹果鲁萨，以查明那里发生了什么。
